    "Je bent om %@ begonnen. De teller telt vanaf dat moment, dus wat je sindsdien verdiend hebt staat er meteen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You started at %@. The counter counts from that moment, so what you have earned since then shows up right away."
