    "Let op: je eindtijd is al voorbij, dus de teller staat direct op het volle bedrag. Begin je nu pas? Tik dan op \"Begin nu\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: your end time has already passed, so the counter will show the full amount right away. Only starting now? Tap \"Begin now\"."
